        "comments": "The assembly laPotPusi1.hap1.1 is based on 63x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 2 (0-2.68 Mbp) and chromosome 4 (2.5-6.2 Mbp). A haplotypic inversion was obeserved on chromosome 5 (10.3-11.3 Mbp).",
